The problem lies with my unit offsets, and the fact that my HSG is in
transparent mode.

For transparent mode, the units 0-99 show on  port1, and units 100-199
show on port2=20
as opposed to multi-path where units 0 to 199 show on both ports.

Therefore, for the system to see it, taking into account the unit
offset, the units should=20
be between 21 - 99 for port 1 and 121-199 for port 2.

Why the unit offsets ?,  this HSG is currently shared with a Tru64 V4.0f
cluster, and I simply wanted
to separate the two enviroments, I think this is called selective
presentation.  We also have another
SAN, that is a mix of Windows and Tru64, again we use unit offsets to
separate the two environements.

Darren

