Thank you to James Kurtenbach, looks my use of the term "selective
presentation"
was incorrect.  I will post James response :

Selective storage presentation is available at the unit level.  The
following command would allow d101 to selectively be presented to only
cluster1 and cluster2, but no other nodes (connections).

HSG80> set d101 disable=3Dall enable=3D(cluster1, cluster2)

Darren

