I quote his solution,=20

The license is sized to the system model.  It's probably the case that
the license you have is sized for a smaller system, at least, that's
what that error message is supposed to mean.  If the license has the
MOD-UNITS attribute, you can use lmf to change the units to zero which
means "unlimited capacity".

